nt-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;color:#418683;-webkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(65, 134, 131, 0.4);}.css-e38i3q:hover{text-decoration-color:inherit;}</style><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-e38i3q\" href=\"/clubs/house-techno.html\" target=\"_blank\">House</a> | </span><span><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-e38i3q\" href=\"/clubs/hip-hop-rnb.html\" target=\"_blank\">R&amp;B</a> | </span><span><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-e38i3q\" href=\"/clubs/funk-soul-disco.html\" target=\"_blank\">Soul</a> | </span><span><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-e38i3q\" href=\"/clubs/funk-soul-disco.html\" target=\"_blank\">Funk</a> | </span><span><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-e38i3q\" href=\"/whats-on/events/London/?genre=57\" target=\"_blank\">Disco</a></span></p></div></div><hr class=\"MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1kdagfr\"/></div><div id=\"about\" class=\"css-oh7gsz\"><style data-emotion=\"css 15ba2s1\">.css-15ba2s1{margin:0.5em 0px;font-size:28px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;line-height:32px;letter-spacing:-0.015em;text-align:left;font-family:BuenosAires;}@media (min-width:600px){.css-15ba2s1{font-size:48px;line-height:56px;}}</style><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 css-15ba2s1\">About</h2><style data-emotion=\"css j9d3gw\">.css-j9d3gw{margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:-16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;}</style><div class=\"MuiBox-root css-j9d3gw\"><style data-emotion=\"css 1r2f04i\">.css-1r2f04i{margin-bottom:10px;}</style><div class=\"MuiBox-root css-1r2f04i\"><style data-emotion=\"css 1qjmxws\">.css-1qjmxws{-webkit-transition:height 450ms;transition:height 450ms;height:450px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;margin-bottom:0px;}.css-1qjmxws::after{-webkit-transition:height 450ms;transition:height 450ms;position:absolute;bottom:0;height:60%;width:100%;content:\"\";background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(255,255,255, 1) 10%, rgba(255,255,255, 0) 90%);pointer-events:none;}</style><div class=\"MuiBox-root css-1qjmxws\"><div class=\"MuiBox-root css-0\"><div><p>THE LIGHTS ARE BACK ON!</p>\n<h3>PLAZA CAMDEN &#8211; EXCLUSIVE FREE PREVIEW EVENT</h3>\n<p><strong>Saturday 17th October | 6PM &#8211; Midnight</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A London landmark is reborn. A new era for Camden begins.</strong></p>\n<p>After decades as one of London's most iconic cinema destinations, the historic Parkway cinema opens its doors once again, reimagined as <strong>PLAZA Camden</strong> &#8211; an exciting new home for music, entertainment, cinema, arts and culture.</p>\n<p>To celebrate this exciting new chapter, you're invited to join us on <strong>Saturday 17th October</strong> for a special <strong>FREE PREVIEW EVENT</strong>, offering a first look inside Camden's newest entertainment destination.</p>\n<p>Experience the atmosphere of this magnificent historic venue as <strong>GOD MADE ME FUNKY</strong> takes over for an evening of feel-good music, bringing together the very best in House, Garage, R&amp;B, Disco, Soul and Funk, with DJs on rotation throughout the night.</p>\n<p>Expect great music, incredible surroundings, cinema screen visuals and a celebration worthy of this legendary London landmark.</p>\n<p><strong>Be among the first to experience PLAZA Camden as the lights come back on!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>FREE ENTRY | SATURDAY 17TH OCTOBER | 6PM&#8211;12AM</strong></p>\n<p>PLAZA Camden<br>14 The Parkway, Camden, London NW1 7AA</p>\n<p><strong>A HISTORIC VENUE. A NEW BEGINNING. ONE UNFORGETTABLE NIGHT.</strong></p></div></div></div><button style=\"cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;color:#131313;border:n