\"Plaza Camden\",\"event\":{\"id\":43016469,\"eventName\":\"Plaza Preview Night - Hosted by God Made Me Funky\",\"eventCode\":\"LIVE\",\"cancelled\":0,\"cancellationDate\":null,\"cancellation\":{\"cancelled\":0,\"date\":null,\"rescheduledDate\":null,\"rescheduledStartDate\":null,\"rescheduledEndDate\":null,\"type\":null,\"rescheduledFromListingId\":null,\"rescheduledFromListingInstanceId\":null,\"rescheduledToListingId\":null,\"rescheduledToListingInstanceId\":null},\"seatingWorkspaceKey\":null,\"link\":\"https://www.skiddle.com/whats-on/London/Plaza-Camden/Plaza-Preview-Night---Hosted-by-God-Made-Me-Funky/43016469/\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"\",\"cancellationRescheduledFromLID\":null,\"cancellationRescheduledToLID\":null,\"venue\":{\"id\":142233,\"name\":\"Plaza Camden\",\"nameLink\":\"https://www.skiddle.com/whats-on/London/Plaza-Camden/\",\"town\":\"London\",\"townLink\":\"https://www.skiddle.com/cities/London/\",\"address\":\"14 Parkway\",\"postcode\":\"NW1 7AA\",\"type\":\"Other\",\"hasHotelPage\":false,\"hasSeatingPlans\":false,\"latitude\":51.5388435,\"longitude\":-0.1435864},\"imageUrl\":\"https://d31fr2pwly4c4s.cloudfront.net/6/4/d/2447632_543cb2fd_plaza-preview-night-hosted-by-god-made-me-funky_th.jpg\",\"largeImageUrl\":\"https://d31fr2pwly4c4s.cloudfront.net/6/4/d/2447632_543cb2fd_plaza-preview-night-hosted-by-god-made-me-funky.jpg\",\"xLargeImageUrl\":\"https://d31fr2pwly4c4s.cloudfront.net/6/4/d/2447632_543cb2fd_plaza-preview-night-hosted-by-god-made-me-funky_1024.jpg\",\"flyerImageUrls\":{\"main\":\"https://d31fr2pwly4c4s.cloudfront.net/6/4/d/2447632_e20de2ff_plaza-preview-night-hosted-by-god-made-me-funky_eflyer.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://d31fr2pwly4c4s.cloudfront.net/6/4/d/2447632_e20de2ff_plaza-preview-night-hosted-by-god-made-me-funky_eflyer_th.jpg\"},\"flyerImageVersion\":0,\"queueEnabled\":false,\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"startDate\":\"2026-10-17T18:00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-18T00:00:00\",\"description\":\"One of Londons historic Venues will re open as PLAZA Camden. To celebrate join us for a free event hosted by GMMF\",\"openingTimes\":{\"doorsOpen\":\"18:00\",\"doorsClose\":\"00:00\",\"lastEntry\":\"18:00\"},\"minAge\":\"21\",\"tickets\":1,\"eventVisibility\":\"public\",\"headerTextColor\":1,\"headerHex\":\"#080808\",\"promoterId\":\"304334\",\"listingId\":\"2447632\",\"masterListingId\":0,\"masterListingInstanceId\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"active\":\"1\",\"seatingPlanId\":null,\"displayDate\":\"Saturday 17th October 2026\",\"displayTime\":\"6:00pm til 12:00am (Performance starts 6:00pm)\",\"fullDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTHE LIGHTS ARE BACK ON!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003ePLAZA CAMDEN \\u0026#8211; EXCLUSIVE FREE PREVIEW EVENT\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSaturday 17th October | 6PM \\u0026#8211; Midnight\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA London landmark is reborn. A new era for Camden begins.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAfter decades as one of London's most iconic cinema destinations, the historic Parkway cinema opens its doors once again, reimagined as \\u003cstrong\\u003ePLAZA Camden\\u003c/strong\\u003e \\u0026#8211; an exciting new home for music, entertainment, cinema, arts and culture.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eTo celebrate this exciting new chapter, you're invited to join us on \\u003cstrong\\u003eSaturday 17th October\\u003c/strong\\u003e for a special \\u003cstrong\\u003eFREE PREVIEW EVENT\\u003c/strong\\u003e, offering a first look inside Camden's newest entertainment destination.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eExperience the atmosphere of this magnificent historic venue as \\u003cstrong\\u003eGOD MADE ME FUNKY\\u003c/strong\\u003e takes over for an evening of feel-good music, bringing together the very best in House, Garage, R\\u0026amp;B, Disco, Soul and Funk, with DJs on rotation throughout the night.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eExpect great music, incredible surroundings, cinema screen visuals and a celebration worthy of this legendary London landmark.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBe among the first to experience PLAZA Camden as the lights come back on!\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFREE ENTRY | SATURDAY 17TH OCTOBER | 6PM\\u0026#8211;12AM\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003ePLAZA Camden\\u003cbr\\u003e14 The Parkway, Camden, London NW1 7AA\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA HISTORIC VENUE. A NEW BEGINNING. ONE UNFORGETTABLE NIGHT.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ticketStatusText\":\"Get Tickets\",\"deliveryMethods\":{\"etickets\":false,\"rapidscan\":true,\"recorded\":false,\"special\":false,\"intSpecial\":false,\"externalApp\":false},\"rapidScanTiers\":[{\"fee\":0,\"max\":10,\"min\":0},{\"fee\":0.8,\"max\":45,\"min\":10.01},{\"fee\":1.05,\"max\":75,\"min\":45.01},{\"fee\":1.6,\"max\":100,\"min\":75.01},{\"fee\":2.1,\"max\":null,\"min\":100.01}],\"genres\":[{\"genreId\":\"1\",\"name\":\"House\",\"landing\":\"/clubs/house-techno.html\"},{\"genreId\":\"4\",\"name\":\"R\\u0026B\",\"landing\":\"/clubs/hip-hop-rnb.html\"},{\"genreId\":\"43\",\"name\":\"Soul\",\"landing\":\"/clubs/funk-soul-disco.html\"},{\"genreId\":\"45\",\"name\":\"Funk\",\"landing\":\"/clubs/funk-soul-disco.html\"},{\"genreId\":\"57\",\"name\":\"Disco\",\"landing\":null}],\"adwordsAdsTrackingID\":null,\"adwordsAdsTrackingLabel\":null,\"googleAnalyticsAccountID\":null,\"adwordsAdsTrackingCurrency\":null,\"facebookAdsTrackingID\":null,\"facebookAdsTrackingMode\":\"checkout\",\"firstDayListingInstance\":43016469,\"preview\":{\"status\":false,\"text\":null},\"groupingId\":null,\"allowResale\":0,\"listingType\":\"single\",\"processing\":false,\"gateway\":\"internal\",\"sessionBased\":false,\"sessionInterval\":null,\"sessionAllocation\":null,\"sessionCount\":0,\"cancelledSessionCount\":0,\"hasFutureEventsInSeries\":false,\"hideHotelMap\":false,\"requireFullAddre